# The Wound Level Chart: Quality Rating against the weapon's Damage Class
# (A to L).  0 Stun, 1 Light, 2 Medium, 3 Heavy, 4 Incapacitated, 5 Killed.
# Wounds add up: two Lights make a Medium, and so on.

